          "published_at": "2026-10-20T17:29:48.455Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/steipete/status/2112597162924351909",
          "topic": "Mostly autonomous Lit-to-Solid frontend migration",
          "text": "Two weeks ago I kicked off a loop to move OpenClaw's Lit-based Web frontend to Solid 2.0.\n\nTook ~6 days until we could remove Lit, and another week to move patterns to idiomatic Solid.\n\nI checked in with the session every other day, overall the process was mostly automatic. Took about ~600 PRs.\n\nResult: Smaller JS and CSS footprint and much more fine-grained update control. Everything feeling more snappy and responsive. team.openclaw.ai/chat/roboclaw/…",
